# The documentation SITE is not product runtime. Excluding it here keeps it
# out of the builder's `COPY apps ./apps`, so the image's `turbo build` never
# discovers the workspace — its (heavy, Astro) deps are deliberately never
# installed by the manifest-glob `npm ci` in the deps stage (brief 51).
apps/docs
